OL,3,GNEWSA'Missed opportunities' before
OL,4,Anursing home rape - review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man caught allegedly raping a woman
OL,7,Fwith dementia at a nursing home had
OL,8,Fshown concerning behaviour in the days
OL,9,Fleading to the attack, a review found.
OL,11,FStaff walked in on the man, who had an
OL,12,Falcohol-related brain injury, when he
OL,13,Fwas on top of the woman in her room in
OL,14,Fthe Liverpool home in August 2022.
OL,16,FA recent review by Liverpool
OL,17,FSafeguarding Adults Board (SAB) said
OL,18,Fthe man was arrested but was not
OL,19,Fprosecuted as he lacked capacity.
