OL,5,
OL,6,FThe review raised questions about the
OL,7,Fdecision to place him in a mixed sex
OL,8,Ffacility and noted his care plan has
OL,9,Fnot been re-examined despite him
OL,10,Ftouching a staff member
OL,11,Finappropriately, harassing a resident
OL,12,Fand entering the victim's room on a
OL,13,Fprevious occasion.
